Regression and Classification (EX2)

Python implementations for linear regression, polynomial fitting,
and 2D classification decision boundary comparisons.

Code Modules:
- linear_regression.py: LinearRegression model implementation.
- house_price_prediction.py: Train/test split, preprocessing, and
  sampling loss evaluation on housing data.
- polynomial_fitting.py: PolynomialFitting model built on linear
  regression features.
- city_temperature_prediction.py: Data loading and polynomial degree
  evaluation on daily temperatures in Israel.
- classifiers_comparison.py: SVM, Decision Tree, and KNN comparisons
  and decision boundary plots on synthetic datasets.
- utils.py: Helper utilities for classification experiments.
